    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in fun, turn-based battles on a grid. Take back powerful items from enemies. Play a story mode with hard missions and cool surprises. Use different units with special skills. Change your plan depending on the land. Easy to learn, fun to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/463215333d3355f24cffe4ab7c774cec.poster.avif?t=1755104651\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/463215333d3355f24cffe4ab7c774cec.webm?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/463215333d3355f24cffe4ab7c774cec.mp4?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/154d64a56471d19fdb05bc119583631b.webp?t=1755104651\" width=247 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and use many different units in smart ways. Each one has its own power and skill. Some are fast, others are strong. Try new plans in each fight to keep the game fun and exciting. Every battle feels new when you mix and match your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/57b97642b2b591120baf31b55db4d741.poster.avif?t=1755104651\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/57b97642b2b591120baf31b55db4d741.webm?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/57b97642b2b591120baf31b55db4d741.mp4?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/91df5eb36c505435efc18b6156a028f1.webp?t=1755104651\" width=196 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield changes how your units fight. Forests, mountains, and roads give different effects. Some places make you stronger, others make you weaker. To win, you must choose smart moves and change your plan depending on where you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/e29a74210b09105c8d2ea864c3d06f01.poster.avif?t=1755104651\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/e29a74210b09105c8d2ea864c3d06f01.webm?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/e29a74210b09105c8d2ea864c3d06f01.mp4?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/3887df1108f3502cb5307a0f39ab12b2.webp?t=1755104651\" width=235 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a colorful world that blends 2D and 3D art. Fun character designs and rich backgrounds make each scene exciting to look at. The playful style brings the story and action to life. From cities to forests, every place feels alive, helping you enjoy both battles and adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/3559fa53bc48b46f5df8587d91f2727e.poster.avif?t=1755104651\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/3559fa53bc48b46f5df8587d91f2727e.webm?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/3559fa53bc48b46f5df8587d91f2727e.mp4?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/4655350af8c43678e168d771753b3bc0.webp?t=1755104651\" width=252 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in level editor to make your own maps. You can create endless new places to play and try fresh strategies. Design unique battlefields that fit your style. Share your maps with friends or challenge yourself with new challenges. This tool lets your creativity run free and keeps the game fun and different every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/b0791394d3881eff5a6dfc162de1eee8.poster.avif?t=1755104651\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/b0791394d3881eff5a6dfc162de1eee8.webm?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/b0791394d3881eff5a6dfc162de1eee8.mp4?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in fun, turn-based battles on a grid. Take back powerful items from enemies. Play a story mode with hard missions and cool surprises. Use different units with special skills. Change your plan depending on the land. Easy to learn, fun to master!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/463215333d3355f24cffe4ab7c774cec.poster.avif?t=1755104651\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/463215333d3355f24cffe4ab7c774cec.webm?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/463215333d3355f24cffe4ab7c774cec.mp4?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/154d64a56471d19fdb05bc119583631b.webp?t=1755104651\" width=247 height=34 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose and use many different units in smart ways. Each one has its own power and skill. Some are fast, others are strong. Try new plans in each fight to keep the game fun and exciting. Every battle feels new when you mix and match your team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/57b97642b2b591120baf31b55db4d741.poster.avif?t=1755104651\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/57b97642b2b591120baf31b55db4d741.webm?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/57b97642b2b591120baf31b55db4d741.mp4?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/91df5eb36c505435efc18b6156a028f1.webp?t=1755104651\" width=196 height=36 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield changes how your units fight. Forests, mountains, and roads give different effects. Some places make you stronger, others make you weaker. To win, you must choose smart moves and change your plan depending on where you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/e29a74210b09105c8d2ea864c3d06f01.poster.avif?t=1755104651\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/e29a74210b09105c8d2ea864c3d06f01.webm?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/e29a74210b09105c8d2ea864c3d06f01.mp4?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/3887df1108f3502cb5307a0f39ab12b2.webp?t=1755104651\" width=235 height=35 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a colorful world that blends 2D and 3D art. Fun character designs and rich backgrounds make each scene exciting to look at. The playful style brings the story and action to life. From cities to forests, every place feels alive, helping you enjoy both battles and adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/3559fa53bc48b46f5df8587d91f2727e.poster.avif?t=1755104651\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/3559fa53bc48b46f5df8587d91f2727e.webm?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/3559fa53bc48b46f5df8587d91f2727e.mp4?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/4655350af8c43678e168d771753b3bc0.webp?t=1755104651\" width=252 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the built-in level editor to make your own maps. You can create endless new places to play and try fresh strategies. Design unique battlefields that fit your style. Share your maps with friends or challenge yourself with new challenges. This tool lets your creativity run free and keeps the game fun and different every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/b0791394d3881eff5a6dfc162de1eee8.poster.avif?t=1755104651\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/b0791394d3881eff5a6dfc162de1eee8.webm?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266580/extras/b0791394d3881eff5a6dfc162de1eee8.mp4?t=1755104651\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p>",
    "short_description": "APES WARFARE is a turn-based strategy game where you command an army of apes equipped with modern &amp; next-gen warfare units, similar to classic titles in the genre. Train your units, seize new territories, and engage in fast-paced battles across whimsical 2D + 3D terrains that shape your strategy.",
